look glass
# Field x620..1300 y216..272 (centre 960,244); Clear ~(1252,244), Ask ~(1280,244) (Ask alone ~1272); results from y280, rows 40 px, first row centre ~(960,310) under a heading.
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
# NOTE: earlier result: Glass accent was red-coral in Rust vs orange in QML (FAIL 1), icons monochrome (FAIL 2); re-check both.
rec sp-g-open 1 ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
note Opens in 220 ms, slides 10 px down while fading; QML/Rust frame counts within 1.
wait 1
rec sp-g-close 1 key -k Escape
note Closes in 220 ms (exit curve); QML/Rust frame counts within 1.
wait 1
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
key foot
wait 1
shot sp-g-foot
note Results glass below the field; headings in caption type; selected row accent-filled in ORANGE as QML (not red).
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 glide 1280 244 300
wait 1
shot sp-g-ask-hover
note Ask turns secondary (hover).
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 glide 1252 244 300
wait 1
shot sp-g-clear-hover
note Clear turns secondary (hover).
ptr move 1252 244 click
wait 1
shot sp-g-cleared
note After clicking Clear the field is empty; typing goes to the field.
key foo
wait 1
shot sp-g-typed-after-clear
note "foo" typed into the field (focus returned).
# keys: with >=2 results Tab moves selection
key -k Tab
shot sp-g-tab-sel
note With 2+ results Tab moves the selection to the next row.
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
key -k BackSpace
key fo
wait 1
key -M shift -k Tab -m shift
shot sp-g-shifttab
note Shift+Tab from the field puts the focus ring on Ask (then Clear, then field with more presses).
key -M shift -k Tab -m shift
shot sp-g-shifttab2
note Focus ring now on Clear.
key -k space
wait 1
shot sp-g-space-clear
note Space on Clear clears the field.
# MANUAL: with exactly 1 result Tab -> Clear ringed, again -> Ask, again -> field (the web row always exists, earlier NOT TESTABLE)
ptr move 960 900 click
wait 1
shot sp-g-outside-click
note Click at (960,900) closes Search.
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 960 244 click
wait 1
shot sp-g-inside-click
note Click at (960,244) in the field keeps Search open.
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
key -k BackSpace
key 12*3
wait 1
shot sp-g-answer
note Answer card with orange 52 px tile, "36", "Enter copies it".
key -k Escape
